        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Kangxi Emperor</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1654 CE – 1722 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">4 May 1654 in Jingren Palace, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/forbidden-city">Forbidden City</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/beijing">Beijing</a>, as Xuanye; third son of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/shunzhi-emperor">Shunzhi Emperor</a> and Empress Xiaokangzhang</span></div>
